Vendors and riders register, then wait as "pending" until an admin approves them. Admin dashboard shows pending vendor and rider approvals with approve, reject and suspend actions. Pending or suspended vendors must not appear in the marketplace. Order statuses: pending, confirmed, preparing, ready for pickup, out for delivery, delivered, cancelled. Only valid status changes are allowed. Students see live status updates (Supabase Realtime). When a delivery order is confirmed, create a delivery request that approved riders can claim; claiming must be atomic so two riders cannot take the same delivery.
